{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/oaoda9","slideIndex":7,"text":"We tested real policy-driven motion but reliable blue-plate pick-and-place is not established. Both learned policies produced out-of-range targets. CPU parity reproduced ACT overshoot, so we added an offline-tested small-overshoot projection and rejection helper without relaxing hardware limits. This does not solve the policy task. Sources: evidence/action-limit-audit; docs/POLICY-ACTION-LIMIT-AUDIT.md; docs/SUBMISSION.md."}
